OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over 'evil' fraudsters
OL,4,Aposing as police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been warned that fraudsters
OL,7,Fare posing as police officers
OL,8,Fpersuading people they call to hand
OL,9,Fover their bank details.
OL,11,FGloucestershire Constabulary said it
OL,12,Fhad been contacted by other police
OL,13,Fforces across the country who have
OL,14,Freceived calls about bogus officers
OL,15,Fclaiming to be based at Hester's Way
OL,16,FPolice Station in Cheltenham.
OL,18,FThe criminals have been using
OL,19,Ftechnology to imitate the station's
OL,20,Fphone number and made calls to people
OL,21,Facross the country.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
