OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over 'evil' fraudsters
OL,4,Aposing as police
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetective Inspector Marcus McInerney,
OL,7,Fhead of Economic and Cyber Crime, said
OL,8,Fthe "manipulative" fraudsters would
OL,9,F"gladly see you spend your life
OL,10,Fsavings, remortgage your house, take
OL,11,Feverything and leave you ruined".
